I like the random teleports, once I can control them. There is
something to it though, that could be improved. I'd like a switch (like
the "@" for the autopickup) that you could use once you had TP+TPC. If
you set "noteleport" the game would automatically leave you at the same
place when it decided it was time for your random teleport. If you set
"teleport" the game would behave as it does now.

The same could be done for POLY+CONTROL: if you were to polymorph, but
had control, you should be able to remain the same (automatically) if
you wished. You would of course still revert to your old form if the
game deemed it necessary.

